  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nWe have to interchange the mathematical signs with & and find the correct option.\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) **×, ÷, ×, ×, -, +, =\n\n**Given: - **[{(42 & 26) & (12 & 2)} & (4 & 5)] & 5 & 10\n\nAfter putting the mathematical we get the;\n\n⇒ [{__**(42 × 26) **__÷ __**(12 × 2)**__} × (4 - 5)] + 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [{__**(1092 ÷ 24)**__} × (4 - 5)] + 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [(45.5 × __**(4 - 5)**__] + 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [__**(45.5 × (-1)**__] + 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**- 45.5 + 5 **__= 10\n\n⇒ - 40.5 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS.**\n\n**Option 2) **×, -, +, ×, ÷, ×, =\n\nGiven: - [{(42 & 26) & (12 & 2)} & (4 & 5)] & 5 & 10\n\nAfter putting the mathematical we get the;\n\n⇒ [{(__**42 × 26) **__- __**(12 + 2)**__} × (4 ÷ 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [__**{1092 - 14}**__ × (4 ÷ 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒__** [(1078) × (0.8)] **__× 5 = 10\n\n⇒ 862.4 × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ 3449.6 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 3) **-, +, ×, ×, ÷, ×, =\n\nGiven: - [{(42 & 26) & (12 & 2)} & (4 & 5)] & 5 & 10\n\nAfter putting the mathematical we get the;\n\n⇒ [{__**(42 - 26)**__ + __**(12 × 2)**__} × (4 ÷ 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [__**{16 + 24}**__ × (4 ÷ 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒__** [(40) × (0.8)] **__× 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**32 × 5 **__= 10\n\n⇒ 160 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**Option 4) **-, +, ×, ÷, ×, ×, =\n\nGiven: - [{(42 & 26) & (12 & 2)} & (4 & 5)] & 5 & 10\n\nAfter putting the mathematical we get the;\n\n⇒ [{__**(42 - 26)**__ + __**(12 × 2)**__} ÷ (4 × 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [__**{16 + 24} **__÷ (4 × 5)] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ [40 ÷ __**(4 × 5)**__] × 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**[40 ÷ 20] **__× 5 = 10\n\n⇒ __**2 × 5**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 10 = 10\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\".**",
